## Package Structure

```
models/
├── library/          # All definitions (part def, calc def, etc.)
│   ├── foundation/   # Base types, materials, units
│   ├── components/   # Component definitions
│   └── analyses/     # Calc definitions
├── designs/          # All usages (specific instances)
│   └── {design_name}/
└── tests/            # Test models
```

